    <Positioned left="64" top="2130.72" width="291.899">
      <Text fontSize="22" color="#2E7D5B" fontFamily="Noto Sans CJK SC" fontStyle="BOLD">√ 数字与图形同一次计算</Text>
    </Positioned>
    <Positioned left="384" top="2132.72" width="738.688">
      <Text fontSize="20" color="#3D4C59" fontFamily="Noto Sans CJK SC">站点、任务、季度数据都来自同一份 data.py，图上任何数字可回查。</Text>
    </Positioned>
    <Positioned left="64" top="2172.72" width="241.739">
      <Text fontSize="22" color="#2E7D5B" fontFamily="Noto Sans CJK SC" fontStyle="BOLD">√ 等级色只表达等级</Text>
    </Positioned>
    <Positioned left="384" top="2174.72" width="534.4">
      <Text fontSize="20" color="#3D4C59" fontFamily="Noto Sans CJK SC">红橙青绿不用于装饰，不做渐变填充，不做分类色。</Text>
    </Positioned>
    <Positioned left="64" top="2214.72" width="241.739">
      <Text fontSize="22" color="#2E7D5B" fontFamily="Noto Sans CJK SC" fontStyle="BOLD">√ 按观看距离定字号</Text>
    </Positioned>
    <Positioned left="384" top="2216.72" width="735.952">
      <Text fontSize="20" color="#3D4C59" fontFamily="Noto Sans CJK SC">手机 11–14 px、讲义 18–20 px、海报 ≥26 px、地贴 ≥44 px。</Text>
    </Positioned>
    <Positioned left="64" top="2256.72" width="191.579">
      <Text fontSize="22" color="#C6412F" fontFamily="Noto Sans CJK SC" fontStyle="BOLD">× 不改标记比例</Text>
    </Positioned>
    <Positioned left="384" top="2258.72" width="564.952">
      <Text fontSize="20" color="#3D4C59" fontFamily="Noto Sans CJK SC">不拉伸、不加描边阴影、不把水面换成 emoji 波浪。</Text>
    </Positioned>
    <Positioned left="64" top="2298.72" width="191.579">
      <Text fontSize="22" color="#C6412F" fontFamily="Noto Sans CJK SC" fontStyle="BOLD">× 不伪造可扫码</Text>
    </Positioned>
    <Positioned left="384" top="2300.72" width="557.2">
      <Text fontSize="20" color="#3D4C59" fontFamily="Noto Sans CJK SC">装饰码块必须带「不可扫描」，真实入口写小程序名。</Text>
    </Positioned>
    <Positioned left="64" top="2340.72" width="216.659">
      <Text fontSize="22" color="#C6412F" fontFamily="Noto Sans CJK SC" fontStyle="BOLD">× 不宣称真实部署</Text>
